[{"title":"移居巴陵","author":"陈昂","text":"此即巴丘戍，相传鲁肃城。\n古今余往事，兵火剩残生。\n楚水为渔便，湘湄赖舌耕。\n地灵如获托，亦足寄遐情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4229,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"进云安","author":"陈昂","text":"渐失乌蛮瘴，新逢白帝寒。\n霜催沙碛奋，风弄叶声干。\n峰渺孤烟直，江空落日团。\n布帆报无恙，今夜进云安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4230,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泊云安","author":"陈昂","text":"短褐丝丝断，为冬不亦难。\n芦花装被暖，枫叶受霜干。\n溪日恩终厚，山风势未寒。\n此间多美酒，生计卜云安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4231,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沙市","author":"陈昂","text":"此乡如地肺，一望渺无山。\n春在楼台里，江浮花鸟间。\n荆州不愿识，王粲未能还。\n渔钓堪糊口，柴扉昼亦关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4232,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋上白帝城登白帝楼","author":"陈昂","text":"石壁将天压，山楼反不奇。\n英雄云散后，烟霭日斜时。\n碧涧秋光老，青林鸟梦宜。\n樽前多感慨，衰柳已先知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4233,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"风色","author":"陈昂","text":"风色一以变，林光反不禁。\n黄姑依淡月，白帝动清砧。\n万里无家客，孤灯独坐心。\n予行濡且滞，舟楫岂难寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4234,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春题瀼西新赁草堂","author":"陈昂","text":"峡口联江口，山乡亦水乡。\n春来容膝屋，云倚及肩墙。\n旅食亦求静，偷生且善藏。\n瀼西居颇适，好赋反骚章。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4235,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"日暮遣闷","author":"陈昂","text":"欲尽西倾日，全低东去天。\n雪峰沉万籁，监井淡孤烟。\n故国兵戈后，他乡冻馁年。\n寥寥今夜客，道自洞庭边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4236,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贵忘","author":"陈昂","text":"野桥亦浅促，朝徙水云乡。\n浦近寻鱼腹，山佳问麝香。\n仗龟行度口，养鹤畏分粮。\n莫把愁肠结，衰年在贵忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4237,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过涪州","author":"陈昂","text":"寥落一涪州，惊心几度游。\n屡更新地主，不改旧沙鸥。\n片月穿仙岭，微云止戍楼。\n山山寒气甚，夜半拥重裘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4238,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"还家晚坐","author":"陈昂","text":"最厌长为客，还家秋雨中。\n饥容叹妻子，败叶理梧桐。\n俗觉今时换，人怜前辈空。\n青青一双眼，落日送冥鸿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4239,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖面","author":"陈昂","text":"湖面初秋色，清如镜里清。\n潮来飞白鹭，烟至织黄莺。\n虹学美人出，风为少女行。\n此间尘不到，身世两忘情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4240,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"一路","author":"陈昂","text":"一路颇幽闲，行行又几湾。\n微茫听竹籁，次第较花颜。\n林壑千层瀑，茅堂四面山。\n卜居如得此，日日闭柴关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4241,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴中春暮寄友","author":"陈昂","text":"劳矣条风力，吹成万绿稠。\n杨花衔小燕，荇带曳轻鸥。\n别后多乡梦，贫深悲旅愁。\n东吴三月路，破碎黑貂裘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4242,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有令赋残荷遂口占","author":"陈昂","text":"万木方零落，荷先叶自伤。\n既圆应有破，久翠渐多黄。\n盖或随波荡，茎犹惹露香。\n蓐收无赖日，恼杀两鸳鸯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4243,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白帝城月下在路","author":"陈昂","text":"马体汗如雨，余应有苦辛。\n独支天外路，易困斗南人。\n乳虎游斜日，苍猿聒暮春。\n那期故国月，白帝照悬鹑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4244,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨后天晴放舟下峡","author":"陈昂","text":"雨后虹方挂，晴来雾始收。\n风光明翠岫，江色淡新秋。\n返照薰残湿，寒潮踏急流。\n放舟下三峡，定醉仲宣楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4245,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初归跃马涧招长干忠公","author":"陈昂","text":"万事不如意，方知无事闲。\n傍墙分暖日，移榻就春山。\n黄鸟飞初下，清泉汲正还。\n题书寄开士，带月掩柴关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4246,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行至杨子县寄茅山道士","author":"陈昂","text":"我行杨子县，此路有谁同。\n堤上时时雨，帆边飒飒风。\n金从结客尽，诗为落花穷。\n句曲云何白，看云怅望空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4247,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"镜中","author":"陈昂","text":"镜中双鬓雪，相见更相怜。\n偃蹇居牛后，敲推敢马前。\n一家寒露叶，万事暮秋蝉。\n开口不曾笑，人间八九年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4248,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白云岩晚归道中","author":"陈昂","text":"一得高僧论，归途落日中。\n鸠筇迎霁月，渔笛唤凉风。\n是象渐欲暝，有生能不空。\n迷心如可悟，身世付秋蓬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4249,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日东林寺","author":"陈昂","text":"欲寻神运殿，一径尽莓苔。\n钟响日先落，溪荒月少来。\n大都身后事，难免劫余灰。\n千载相逢晚，白莲不再开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4250,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暑夜与葛九惟善步信州浮桥","author":"陈昂","text":"与子立河麋，于时暑渐歇。\n一鸣峰杪钟，遂见沙头月。\n村火射偏红，萤灯飞欲没。\n安得绪风凉，凉风吹濯发。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4251,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬日双林寺（时予家于豫章）","author":"陈昂","text":"可见无人境，门前与世分。\n钟声停半壑，水面湛孤云。\n宿火灰中陷，邻舂雨外勤。\n豫章二百里，消息不相闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4252,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"坐法药寺楼","author":"陈昂","text":"楼居固所好，安可对斜阳。\n天外连芳草，云边望故乡。\n双星分四野，一雁应初霜。\n满目蘋风起，扁舟意敢忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4253,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿双溪铺","author":"陈昂","text":"不有双溪宿，能知孤客情。\n山川沉月色，天地变秋声。\n华发明残烛，疏星滞五更。\n出门纯鸟道，肯信马蹄轻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4254,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过陈州宿小庵","author":"陈昂","text":"一雨荒精舍，孤吟见早霜。\n禽寒移密树，萤湿定疏篁。\n入洛空携赋，过陈易绝粮。\n不眠数更点，二十五声长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4255,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"坐久","author":"陈昂","text":"一生既错料，万事遂飘零。\n妻子动相谪，诗书竟不灵。\n哀哀何处雁，脉脉隔溪萤。\n坐久西风急，寒天尚未青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4256,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"羁旅无聊自嘲","author":"陈昂","text":"世态久方见，人生已浪过。\n长鸣学蜀帝，善泪像湘娥。\n雨掩春山重，江埋宿雾多。\n紫貂裘敝尽，季子不归何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4257,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"濠州道中","author":"陈昂","text":"清晨迷野渡，春水正茫然。\n淮泗如浮地，荆涂欲挡天。\n风花林外舞，客梦马头圆。\n匹鸟能高举，云端故不旋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4258,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闲居春闲二首 其一","author":"陈昂","text":"世为沧海客，安有野鸥嗔。\n开户来新月，留花答暮春。\n青山歌送鸟，白眼醉看人。\n此外生涯事，君其问水滨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4259,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闲居春闲二首 其二","author":"陈昂","text":"春水倚天长，春云入径香。\n梨花衔燕子，荇蒂戏鸳鸯。\n白苎朝初试，清言世易忘。\n冠缨如可濯，一笑过沧浪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4260,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郊原","author":"陈昂","text":"郊原方落日，千里转玲珑。\n小阜浮波上，遥天覆镜中。\n葑田齐晚稻，甓社下新鸿。\n谁染淮南景，秋汀蓼尽红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4261,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客中春暮","author":"陈昂","text":"不见春和候，开门失翠微。\n莺声悲冻在，花气怨春稀。\n地远谁修禊，山深未试衣。\n故园怜久别，合眼即能归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4262,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初冬梦燕子矶","author":"陈昂","text":"霜来风遂惨，西谷冻残晖。\n汉水鱼将聚，洞庭柑渐肥。\n他乡愁易结，寒夜梦先归。\n稍待江平稳，舟寻燕子矶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4263,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挂帆","author":"陈昂","text":"挂帆雨霁后，风亦息颠狂。\n去鸟冲烟白，归云压日黄。\n阑凭悬楚岫，柁转失浔阳。\n九派滔滔急，朝宗意颇长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4264,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二十七日立秋夜作","author":"陈昂","text":"是夜秋相见，律归夷则中。\n草心蒙白露，衣领受凉风。\n舞觉蜻蜓爽，声添蟋蟀工。\n吾其先散发，作赋答天公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4265,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"少出","author":"陈昂","text":"少出无乃癖，因之不觉非。\n纷华归世界，天地散春晖。\n飞翠胶莺坐，游丝系燕归。\n杨朱歧路际，南北易沾衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4266,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄山早行","author":"陈昂","text":"客心悬远路，四鼓出重关。\n古庙神灯入，虚岩鬼火闲。\n有烟迷白屋，将雨失青山。\n不觉凉飙起，飞萤渐渐还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4267,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归舟月下寄友","author":"陈昂","text":"万里南归客，风前五两鸣。\n荻苗沛秋水，霜信急前程。\n流落怜妻子，饥寒仗友生。\n遥遥天上月，此夕最关情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4268,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游山归途口占","author":"陈昂","text":"山固飞黄叶，回途秋洒然。\n禽声留落日，驴背稳衰年。\n寒瀑缨林谷，晴溪镜水天。\n何人吹铁笛，随我过前川。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4269,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠叶秀才","author":"陈昂","text":"壮老贫犹故，斯愁不易捐。\n卖文聊旦旦，僦屋且年年。\n酒负今生债，诗留异代缘。\n夜长如不晓，切莫怨苍天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4270,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"不离西阁","author":"陈昂","text":"雨余无一事，虽午户犹关。\n低干禽多睡，残书蠹不闲。\n推窗又见日，散发且看山。\n阁外谈生计，应须老友还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4271,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夕阳道上","author":"陈昂","text":"宇宙一搔首，秋残未暇论。\n天涯款段马，雨后夕阳村。\n叶抱初霜病，鸦招半菽魂。\n渡头灯火起，此际赖匏樽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4272,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"野望","author":"陈昂","text":"信步失幽径，凝眸起苦吟。\n天孤邀旷野，林密引沦阴。\n病叶因风落，空山欲雨沉。\n昏鸦何作怪，勉强噪寒林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4273,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行歌偶成","author":"陈昂","text":"岸涨潮初起，帆开风正匀。\n偷生今老耄，避地久吴秦。\n留眼看明世，行歌混逸民。\n远师陶靖节，漉酒用乌巾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4274,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天问","author":"陈昂","text":"春光从到后，物物露春情。\n雨养枯泉活，烟医病草生。\n梁间添乳燕，柳外啭新莺。\n一饱将天问，何时愿可成？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4275,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"关吾道","author":"陈昂","text":"物物关吾道，予情即若情。\n泥衔飞燕去，花抱仰蜂行。\n浪染秋沙白，云妆晚巘明。\n衰年赖酿黍，方法似生成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4276,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"愁坐","author":"陈昂","text":"兀坐愁何事，方方八节滩。\n孤村浮水上，一雁叫江干。\n谁挂仰天瓦，空扳下坂丸。\n邻家来冀北，翘首问长安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4277,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入清流山宿云庵访忠公","author":"陈昂","text":"虽愧许玄度，远寻支道林。\n溪光围净室，山色证禅心。\n落日飞黄叶，寒风定远禽。\n对床两知己，十载怅分襟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4278,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江南旅情","author":"陈昂","text":"日落青溪栅，潮平白鹭洲。\n林深常似雨，江静易生秋。\n凉月来天外，明河俯渡头。\n飞飞鸿雁影，不见尺书留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4279,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"残秋落日","author":"陈昂","text":"败叶如相约，时时竞远飞。\n露浓秋欲去，寒急市先稀。\n天变扬沧海，山昏失翠微。\n鸣鸦千百点，为我送将归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4280,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早发","author":"陈昂","text":"亦知挂席便，遂听棹歌行。\n病叶星前色，新蝉露里声。\n稍分山影出，遥见海潮明。\n舟子呼同侣，潮头渐渐生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4281,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小至","author":"陈昂","text":"天涯除客子，何者却飘蓬。\n病待微阳起，诗怜小至穷。\n峰阴分鬼火，溪北断渔筒。\n闷坐梅花下，吹来酿雪风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4282,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岁暮书所见","author":"陈昂","text":"老苍到此际，无意作冬天。\n山冻颜先活，冰悬腹不坚。\n雪飞勾细雨，春近逼残年。\n若与梅花隔，斯愁未坦然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4283,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送盛仲交还秣陵","author":"王逢年","text":"盛生东出关，白下桃花满。\n相逢南阳田，目寄孤云远。\n君归江国正鸣鸠，草绿空矶燕子愁。\n与尔期登雨花阁，六朝何处楚江流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4284,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵咏怀","author":"王逢年","text":"奕奕钟山紫气开，壮游弹铗凤皇台。\n上林曙色迎黄鸟，古殿晴阴锁绿苔。\n驰道久虚清跸度，近臣犹似早朝回。\n当年定鼎尊临日，玉帛曾闻万国来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4285,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日草堂漫兴","author":"王逢年","text":"闲庭碧梧澄素阴，南山结庐幽意深。\n将浣未浣溪畔女，欲鸣不鸣枝上禽。\n临觞坐啸还咄咄，岸帻远望何森森。\n黄云澹荡落日冥，一派菱歌烟水浔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4286,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋晓闻鸿","author":"王逢年","text":"斗转砧稀秋夜阑，朔云遥度雁声寒。\n梦回旅馆灯初落，书寄衡阳叶正残。\n隐隐断行迷极浦，苍苍斜月带长安。\n湘南塞北关情远，人倚青楼几处看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4287,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"情诗","author":"王逢年","text":"美人临高楼，青蛾眄来久。\n何许系相思，一带横塘柳。\n横塘柳初齐，梁燕筑巢栖。\n双双飞不去，莫蹴柳花迷。\n柳花拂罗袖，脉脉销清昼。\n离恨几回肠，独援瑶琴奏。\n瑶琴奏还歇，燕掠楼中月。\n似梦昭阳宫，心将露苔结。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4288,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜行郎二首拟古乐府寄所思 其一","author":"王逢年","text":"长寄相思明月楼，夜行郎在海西头。\n月光若共郎行远，那得当窗照妾愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4289,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜行郎二首拟古乐府寄所思 其二","author":"王逢年","text":"昔看明月不如郎，同照菱花伴晓妆。\n别后郎情宁似月，瑶阶随影度孤房。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4290,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"筑楚门枝巢隐居","author":"王逢年","text":"卜筑楚门下，一巢聊自栖。\n夜同蝉沐露，春与燕分泥。\n秦苑楼台没，吴宫日月低。\n浮生已残梦，何事落磻溪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4291,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"海上岁朝","author":"王逢年","text":"海国春初转，还开腊社筵。\n世情回旧历，衰病入新年。\n往事鸡声尽，闲愁柳色偏。\n从兹复朝暮，苏晋浪逃禅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4292,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汉宫篇","author":"王逢年","text":"云蟠象魏接长杨，日拥龙颜坐未央。\n吾道欲兴周礼乐，圣朝空老汉文章。\n九重推毂边人泪，杂佩分花辇路香。\n谁荐《子虚》金马外，汾阴春雨夜苍苍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4293,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蓟门城楼玩月","author":"王逢年","text":"黄尘向晚蓟门深，白石行歌无好音。\n万里登楼今夜月，三秋落木半河砧。\n山空嬴女吹箫泪，天远梁鸿去国心。\n世路不如依漂母，且投书剑钓淮阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4294,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花落","author":"王逢年","text":"朔风凄凄洮水阴，羌声半咽清夜沉。\n征人陇头寄春心，月寒落尽关山深。\n少妇相思搅离色，梦惊鸡塞秦云白。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4295,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"折杨柳","author":"王逢年","text":"边楼夜笛吹霜月，玉门杨柳边人折。\n长条短条系相思，故园东风莺啭枝。\n鸳鸯机上肠应断，绿满天涯人未归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4296,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"虎山桥问渡入五湖","author":"王逢年","text":"野水平芜霸迹消，苍茫万顷乱飞涛。\n参差三弄醉远客，七十二峰迎画桡。\n细雨鸠鸣玄墓树，夕阳僧过虎山桥。\n武陵源口秦人路，莫向浮云问市朝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4297,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南徐暮泊登江上楼","author":"王逢年","text":"烟波如眺武昌楼，宿鹭遥疑鹦鹉洲。\n把酒江山遗事在，侧身天地此生浮。\n中流落照金陵绕，断垒空城铁瓮秋。\n亦是湘南哀郢客，兵戈垂老未归舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4298,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]